Z||000003||theogre||12-17-2000||11:48 PM||||............ Your on AOHell, the biggest spam magnet on earth......... It's all that junk crap you get in your email or will soon if you are a new AOL user.<P>No, you sending out a single mail to a single person or very small group would not be considered spam. Spam is mass mailed, unsolicited, crap that hardly anyone ever wants.<P>The end result is many of us now block all Juno Hotmail and other sites. I haven't added AOL to my filters so you would still get thru. I shouldn't need to do that with AOL since they have things inplace to prevent mass mailings. Juno and Hotmail have had these problems for some time and have only gotten worse.||||reg||1
